WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.670 line:90%,end
When morning came, the sky was full of stones falling like rain.

2
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.630 line:90%,end
Elyra's islands were breaking off one by one.

3
00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:11.500 line:90%,end
Sila is pulling all the crystal network's energy into the fortress.

4
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.530 line:90%,end
The islands are losing their balance.

5
00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:17.410 line:90%,end
The sleeping capsules! The hall is inside an island.

6
00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:20.410 line:90%,end
If the island falls, fourteen people fall with it.

7
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:24.660 line:90%,end
The island under the fortress is shaking too. We have very little time.

8
00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:29.350 line:90%,end
My creatures can hold the bridges. But there are too many bridges!

9
00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.020 line:90%,end
The team split in two.

10
00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:35.490 line:90%,end
Mira and Mony would hold the bridges; the others would run to the fortress.

11
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:40.420 line:90%,end
I'll freeze the bridges. Ice is stronger than crystal.

12
00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:43.800 line:90%,end
And I'll stop the falling rocks with my shield. Let's go!

13
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.700 line:90%,end
Mira's ice tied the cracking bridges together.

14
00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:51.240 line:90%,end
Mony's shield smashed the falling rocks in midair.

15
00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:56.470 line:90%,end
Eray, with his creatures, went beneath an island about to break off.

16
00:00:56.770 --> 00:00:59.730 line:90%,end
Come on, friends! All together, lift!

17
00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:05.060 line:90%,end
Thousands of glowing creatures pushed the island up as if carrying it on their shoulders.

18
00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:06.910 line:90%,end
The island stopped where it was.

19
00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:09.920 line:90%,end
Leon, on the right! The bridge is breaking!

20
00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:12.310 line:90%,end
Got it! Anka, give me your hand!

21
00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:17.570 line:90%,end
Anka caught Leon's hand at the last second. They leapt together to the next island.

22
00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:20.590 line:90%,end
But the real danger was beneath the fortress.

23
00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:24.720 line:90%,end
The hall of sleeping capsules had slid to the edge of the cliff.

24
00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:29.760 line:90%,end
Pusula, what can we do?

25
00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:32.750 line:90%,end
You must find the heart of the crystal network, AyShe.

26
00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:37.180 line:90%,end
Only you can awaken it. Just like you did on the first day.

27
00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:42.010 line:90%,end
AyShe pressed the twenty-three mark on her palm against the crystal rock.

28
00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.560 line:90%,end
And closed her eyes.

29
00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:47.210 line:90%,end
Elyra, please. Wake up one more time.

30
00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:52.370 line:90%,end
The blue light from her palm raced through every vein of the crystal network.

31
00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:56.340 line:90%,end
The falling islands stopped in midair and slowly returned to their places.

32
00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.960 line:90%,end
You did it, AyShe! You did it!

33
00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:02.790 line:90%,end
But the light had reached the deepest part of the fortress.

34
00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:06.590 line:90%,end
And there, it awakened something that had slept for centuries.

35
00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:11.770 line:90%,end
A voice is coming from the fortress core. It's calling us. A woman's voice.

36
00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:15.060 line:90%,end
The mark on AyShe's palm glowed again.

37
00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:18.070 line:90%,end
As if someone had been waiting for her for years.

